Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Imagine… the Venom symbiote takes over Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You are in Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Superman flies overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But his blue suit… starts turning black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The symbiote makes every power of its host stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Superman is already faster than a speeding bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now add a creature that is always hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He doesn't save the city anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He hunts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Even kryptonite might not reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But the symbiote has two old weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sound… and fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Superman carries both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heat vision is fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One clap of his hands is a sonic boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It chose the one body it can't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Superman first flew in 1938.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A copy of that comic sold for six million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:12.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Power is never the danger… it's who controls it.
